 change throughout their lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing-site change"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing-process change"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging change"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation change"},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier change"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytical-method change"},{"type":"h","text":"Labeling change"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory professionals assess:"},{"type":"p","text":"Does the change require regulatory notification, approval or documentation?"},{"type":"h","text":"This requires close coordination with:"},{"type":"h","text":"QA"},{"type":"h","text":"QC"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"h","text":"R&D"},{"type":"h","text":"Supply chain"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance"}]},{"heading":"Pharmacovigilance Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory professionals should understand drug safety."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse events"},{"type":"h","text":"Serious adverse events"},{"type":"h","text":"Individual case safety reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Signal detection concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety updates"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk management"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-marketing surveillance"},{"type":"h","text":"Relationship:"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety Signal"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical / Scientific Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Label / Risk Action"}]},{"heading":"Medical Devices & Combination Products","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A regulatory career can expand beyond medicines."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical devices"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnostics"},{"type":"h","text":"Combination products"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health products"},{"type":"h","text":"Software as a medical device"},{"type":"h","text":"In-vitro diagnostics"},{"type":"p","text":"This can be valuable because regulatory professionals increasingly work across multiple healthcare-product categories."}]},{"heading":"International Regulatory Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience in domestic regulatory affairs, specialize in international markets."},{"type":"h","text":"Potential markets include:"},{"type":"h","text":"United States"},{"type":"h","text":"European Union"},{"type":"h","text":"United Kingdom"},{"type":"h","text":"Canada"},{"type":"h","text":"Australia"},{"type":"h","text":"Japan"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging markets"},{"type":"h","text":"Study the differences between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Submission requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Product classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Dossier requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Labeling"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-approval obligations"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not assume that approval in one jurisdiction automatically satisfies another jurisdiction's requirements."}]},{"heading":"Important Regulatory Frameworks to Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an India-focused career, become familiar with the regulatory ecosystem relevant to pharmaceutical products and applicable authorities."},{"type":"p","text":"Internationally, understand the role of organizations/frameworks such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"US FDA"},{"type":"h","text":"EMA"},{"type":"h","text":"MHRA"},{"type":"h","text":"ICH"},{"type":"h","text":"WHO"},{"type":"h","text":"Important areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"GMP"},{"type":"h","text":"GCP"},{"type":"h","text":"GLP"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality systems"},{"type":"h","text":"CTD"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk management"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulations and guidance evolve frequently, so professionals should always use the current official version of applicable requirements."}]},{"heading":"Regulatory Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern regulatory teams increasingly use technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory information management systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Document management systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Submission-management platforms"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic document workflows"},{"type":"h","text":"Data repositories"},{"type":"h","text":"Tracking systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful digital skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Word"},{"type":"h","text":"PowerPoint"},{"type":"h","text":"SharePoint/document systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic database concepts"}]},{"heading":"Data Analytics for Regulatory Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Excel is particularly important."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pivot tables"},{"type":"h","text":"XLOOKUP/VLOOKUP"},{"type":"h","text":"Conditional formatting"},{"type":"h","text":"Data validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboards"},{"type":"h","text":"Deadline tracking"},{"type":"h","text":"Example dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"table","header":["Product","Market","Submission","Status","Deadline"],"rows":[[{"text":"Product A"},{"text":"India"},{"text":"Renewal"},{"text":"In Progress"},{"text":"Q2"}],[{"text":"Product B"},{"text":"EU"},{"text":"Variation"},{"text":"Submitted"},{"text":"Q3"}],[{"text":"Product C"},{"text":"US"},{"text":"Initial"},{"text":"Under Review"},{"text":"Q4"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI can be used to visualize:"},{"type":"h","text":"Submission status"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory timelines"},{"type":"h","text":"Product portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Market approvals"},{"type":"h","text":"Pending actions"},{"type":"h","text":"Upcoming renewals"}]},{"heading":"AI in Regulatory Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI can support:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory document classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature review"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory 